  "duration_s": 485.62069,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九五九年，朱光亚消失了，他去了青海湖边的戈壁滩，一个叫马兰的地方，那地方什么样？抬头是灰的，低头是灰的，风，刮在脸上像刀子割肉，冬天零下三十度哈，口气都能结冰。没有城市，没有实验室，连路都得自己修。就在这种地方，朱光亚和他的同事们干了一件说出来你都不信的事。一为用算盘算原子弹，你没听错，就是老祖宗传下来的那种算盘。几十个人三班倒人歇，算盘不歇，噼里啪啦噼里啪啦一组数据要磕三个月，好不容易算完了，发现小数点后第三位对不上怎么办？全组推倒重来，有人算到半夜，精神崩溃，把算盘砸了。有人算着算着，瘫在地上不动了，朱光雅始终都没掉过一滴泪。只说了一句话，数据必须准确到小数点后第八位第八位是什么概念？差之毫厘谬以千里原子弹，这东西错一个小数点就是几百条人命，就这么一个树，一个树死磕磕了整整十年。这十年里，朱光亚没回过几次家，没陪妻子过过一个像样的生日。北京的家里妻子许慧君一个人带着两个孩子，左手牵一个怀里，抱一个，半夜孩子发烧，他一个人往医院跑。邻居们怎么说？这男人抛妻弃子，怕是死在外面了。许慧君听着这些话，咬着牙一个字都没解释，他不能解释，也解释不了，她自己都不知道丈夫在干什么，只知道他在干一件大事，你说这叫什么？这叫一个女人，用自己的名声和委屈，替丈夫守住了一个国家的秘密。一九六二年，朱光亚牵头拿出了方案定下目标，争取两年左右让原子弹炸响。所有人都觉得她疯了。苏联专家说，二十年都搞出来你两年，但朱光亚心里清楚，没有时间了，外面有人天天拿核弹，指着你晚一天就多一天的危险。一九六四年十月十六号下午三点，罗布泊所有人都趴在观测点，屏住了呼吸，朱光亚站在那里紧紧盯着倒计时三二一起报戈壁滩上空，一道比太阳还亮的闪光炸开。紧接着，一朵巨大的蘑菇云腾空而起。为了这一刻，从他二十一岁远赴美国算起，整整过了十八年，平日里那个克制沉稳，不苟言笑的朱光亚当场洒下了热泪。那天晚上，朱光亚喝醉了，这是他这辈子唯一一次喝醉所有的压力，所有的委屈，所有的银人在那一刻像核弹一样释放了出来。原子弹炸响了，但朱光雅没停。不到三年，一九六七年月，一七号，中国第一颗氢弹爆炸成功。从原子弹到氢弹，美国用了七年三个月，苏联用了六年三个月，中国用了多久不嗯，两年零八个月，这个速度震惊了整个世界。朱光亚这一生参与领导了中国全部四十五次核试验。他说过一句话，我这一辈子主要做的就这一件事，搞中国的核武器。就这一件事儿，他干了一辈子，有人要给他写传记，他把稿件退了回去。有人在两弹一星元勋的名单里写上他的名字，他拿笔划掉了，自己对他来说东西留下就好名字吗？随他去吧。一九九四年，朱光亚全票当选中国工程院首任院长。一九九九年九月十八号，七十五岁的朱光亚终于从幕后走到了台前。他是二十三位两弹一星功勋奖章获得者中，最后一个被解密的当卸下身上所有的重担。那张延素了几十年的脸，终于又一次笑了起来，这发自内心的一笑，一不小心。就相隔了几十个年头，二零零四年国际编号幺零三八八号的小行星被正式命名为朱光亚星。他的名字永远挂在了天上。二零一一年二月二十六号朱光亚走了，享年八十七岁。那天下着大雪，好多人望着天上的雪说，钱学森走的那天也下雪。真巧，其实不是巧，是天在哭。最后我想说被埋进黑暗里的不止朱光雅一个人。二十三位两弹一星元勋，郭永怀飞机失事，用身体护住绝密文件，烧成焦炭，也没松手。邓稼先因核辐射身患重症，临死前说的最后一句话是不要让人家把我们落的太远。这些人干的是惊天动地的事，做的是隐姓埋名的人，他们才是这个国家最硬的脊梁，才是我们最该追的星。说实话，写朱光亚的时候，我翻了大量的资料，越翻越难受。二十三位两弹一星元勋，每一个人的故事单独拿出来都能让你掉眼泪。但说实话，大多数人的名字我们根本叫不上来，他们把一生都给了国家，走的时候，安安静静连张照片都没留下几张。后来我找到了这套国之脊梁，里面写了四十多位中国科学家的真实人生，钱学森、邓稼先、郭永怀、袁隆平。一个一个全是我们这个民族的顶梁柱。他不是那种干巴巴的人物简介，是真写他们怎么吃苦，怎么咬牙，怎么把命豁出去的。读的时候，你会发现这些人不是天生的英雄，他们也是丈夫，是父亲，是儿子。只是在国家需要的时候，选择了把自己藏起来。我建议你买一套自己看也留给孩子看。现在的孩子追着明星唱首歌，拍个戏就被捧上天。但真正该让孩子记住的是，这些在戈壁滩上用算盘算。原子弹的人是这些用身体互助绝密文件的人，让孩子知道这个国家能有今天不是靠运气，是靠一群人拿命换的，这些人不该被遗忘，这套书就是给他们立的一块碑。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1130,
      "text": "一九五九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1470,
      "end_ms": 2670,
      "text": "朱光亚消失了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3350,
      "end_ms": 5790,
      "text": "他去了青海湖边的戈壁滩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6230,
      "end_ms": 7830,
      "text": "一个叫马兰的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8650,
      "end_ms": 9730,
      "text": "那地方什么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10470,
      "end_ms": 11750,
      "text": "抬头是灰的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11750,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "低头是灰的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13010,
      "end_ms": 13250,
      "text": "风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13330,
      "end_ms": 15550,
      "text": "刮在脸上像刀子割肉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15930,
      "end_ms": 17930,
      "text": "冬天零下三十度哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17930,
      "end_ms": 19010,
      "text": "口气都能结冰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19430,
      "end_ms": 20330,
      "text": "没有城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20510,
      "end_ms": 21530,
      "text": "没有实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21790,
      "end_ms": 23090,
      "text": "连路都得自己修。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 23670,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "就在这种地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25110,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "朱光亚和他的同事们干了一件说出来你都不信的事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 29670,
      "end_ms": 31540,
      "text": "一为用算盘算原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31680,
      "end_ms": 32500,
      "text": "你没听错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32820,
      "end_ms": 36100,
      "text": "就是老祖宗传下来的那种算盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36260,
      "end_ms": 38300,
      "text": "几十个人三班倒人歇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 38380,
      "end_ms": 39200,
      "text": "算盘不歇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 39500,
      "end_ms": 42980,
      "text": "噼里啪啦噼里啪啦一组数据要磕三个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43540,
      "end_ms": 45000,
      "text": "好不容易算完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45300,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "text": "发现小数点后第三位对不上怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49100,
      "end_ms": 50700,
      "text": "全组推倒重来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 51180,
      "end_ms": 52420,
      "text": "有人算到半夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 52660,
      "end_ms": 53620,
      "text": "精神崩溃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 54020,
      "end_ms": 55180,
      "text": "把算盘砸了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 55660,
      "end_ms": 57040,
      "text": "有人算着算着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 57180,
      "end_ms": 58660,
      "text": "瘫在地上不动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 58940,
      "end_ms": 61515,
      "text": "朱光雅始终都没掉过一滴泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 62080,
      "end_ms": 63235,
      "text": "只说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63980,
      "end_ms": 70325,
      "text": "数据必须准确到小数点后第八位第八位是什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 70690,
      "end_ms": 74100,
      "text": "差之毫厘谬以千里原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 74100,
      "end_ms": 78085,
      "text": "这东西错一个小数点就是几百条人命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 78540,
      "end_ms": 79520,
      "text": "就这么一个树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 79520,
      "end_ms": 82225,
      "text": "一个树死磕磕了整整十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 83010,
      "end_ms": 83985,
      "text": "这十年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 84240,
      "end_ms": 86015,
      "text": "朱光亚没回过几次家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 86580,
      "end_ms": 89025,
      "text": "没陪妻子过过一个像样的生日。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 89910,
      "end_ms": 93835,
      "text": "北京的家里妻子许慧君一个人带着两个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 94210,
      "end_ms": 95870,
      "text": "左手牵一个怀里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 95870,
      "end_ms": 96565,
      "text": "抱一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 96970,
      "end_ms": 98145,
      "text": "半夜孩子发烧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 98650,
      "end_ms": 100095,
      "text": "他一个人往医院跑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 101400,
      "end_ms": 102300,
      "text": "邻居们怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 102380,
      "end_ms": 104115,
      "text": "这男人抛妻弃子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 104490,
      "end_ms": 105805,
      "text": "怕是死在外面了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 106750,
      "end_ms": 108435,
      "text": "许慧君听着这些话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 108860,
      "end_ms": 111495,
      "text": "咬着牙一个字都没解释，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 111940,
      "end_ms": 112925,
      "text": "他不能解释，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 113230,
      "end_ms": 114075,
      "text": "也解释不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 114510,
      "end_ms": 116825,
      "text": "她自己都不知道丈夫在干什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 117260,
      "end_ms": 119595,
      "text": "只知道他在干一件大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 120360,
      "end_ms": 121380,
      "text": "你说这叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 122280,
      "end_ms": 123600,
      "text": "这叫一个女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 123960,
      "end_ms": 126060,
      "text": "用自己的名声和委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 126560,
      "end_ms": 129220,
      "text": "替丈夫守住了一个国家的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 129820,
      "end_ms": 130900,
      "text": "一九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 131400,
      "end_ms": 134380,
      "text": "朱光亚牵头拿出了方案定下目标，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 134680,
      "end_ms": 138020,
      "text": "争取两年左右让原子弹炸响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 138240,
      "end_ms": 139880,
      "text": "所有人都觉得她疯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 140780,
      "end_ms": 141800,
      "text": "苏联专家说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 141860,
      "end_ms": 143940,
      "text": "二十年都搞出来你两年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 144840,
      "end_ms": 146460,
      "text": "但朱光亚心里清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 146620,
      "end_ms": 147480,
      "text": "没有时间了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 148500,
      "end_ms": 149995,
      "text": "外面有人天天拿核弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 150150,
      "end_ms": 153550,
      "text": "指着你晚一天就多一天的危险。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 154150,
      "end_ms": 157450,
      "text": "一九六四年十月十六号下午三点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 157790,
      "end_ms": 161450,
      "text": "罗布泊所有人都趴在观测点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 161830,
      "end_ms": 162890,
      "text": "屏住了呼吸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 163950,
      "end_ms": 171870,
      "text": "朱光亚站在那里紧紧盯着倒计时三二一起报戈壁滩上空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 172170,
      "end_ms": 174670,
      "text": "一道比太阳还亮的闪光炸开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 174770,
      "end_ms": 175450,
      "text": "紧接着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 175750,
      "end_ms": 179495,
      "text": "一朵巨大的蘑菇云腾空而起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 180100,
      "end_ms": 181075,
      "text": "为了这一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 181830,
      "end_ms": 184885,
      "text": "从他二十一岁远赴美国算起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 185340,
      "end_ms": 187105,
      "text": "整整过了十八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 188310,
      "end_ms": 190515,
      "text": "平日里那个克制沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 191030,
      "end_ms": 194845,
      "text": "不苟言笑的朱光亚当场洒下了热泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 195930,
      "end_ms": 196745,
      "text": "那天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 197670,
      "end_ms": 198895,
      "text": "朱光亚喝醉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 199780,
      "end_ms": 204985,
      "text": "这是他这辈子唯一一次喝醉所有的压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 206080,
      "end_ms": 207305,
      "text": "所有的委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 207770,
      "end_ms": 212145,
      "text": "所有的银人在那一刻像核弹一样释放了出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 212940,
      "end_ms": 214075,
      "text": "原子弹炸响了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 214710,
      "end_ms": 215945,
      "text": "但朱光雅没停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 216460,
      "end_ms": 217240,
      "text": "不到三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 217380,
      "end_ms": 218500,
      "text": "一九六七年月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 218500,
      "end_ms": 219235,
      "text": "一七号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 219710,
      "end_ms": 222285,
      "text": "中国第一颗氢弹爆炸成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 223160,
      "end_ms": 224635,
      "text": "从原子弹到氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 225130,
      "end_ms": 227245,
      "text": "美国用了七年三个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 227700,
      "end_ms": 230085,
      "text": "苏联用了六年三个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 230910,
      "end_ms": 232600,
      "text": "中国用了多久不嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 232750,
      "end_ms": 234295,
      "text": "两年零八个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 234760,
      "end_ms": 237265,
      "text": "这个速度震惊了整个世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 237990,
      "end_ms": 243325,
      "text": "朱光亚这一生参与领导了中国全部四十五次核试验。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 243820,
      "end_ms": 244905,
      "text": "他说过一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 245310,
      "end_ms": 247875,
      "text": "我这一辈子主要做的就这一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 248370,
      "end_ms": 249525,
      "text": "搞中国的核武器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 250700,
      "end_ms": 251715,
      "text": "就这一件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 252490,
      "end_ms": 253435,
      "text": "他干了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 255180,
      "end_ms": 256600,
      "text": "有人要给他写传记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 256700,
      "end_ms": 258145,
      "text": "他把稿件退了回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 258850,
      "end_ms": 262685,
      "text": "有人在两弹一星元勋的名单里写上他的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 263120,
      "end_ms": 264380,
      "text": "他拿笔划掉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 264380,
      "end_ms": 272355,
      "text": "自己对他来说东西留下就好名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 272790,
      "end_ms": 273565,
      "text": "随他去吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 274020,
      "end_ms": 275000,
      "text": "一九九四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 275220,
      "end_ms": 279525,
      "text": "朱光亚全票当选中国工程院首任院长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 280400,
      "end_ms": 282605,
      "text": "一九九九年九月十八号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 283090,
      "end_ms": 287430,
      "text": "七十五岁的朱光亚终于从幕后走到了台前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 287990,
      "end_ms": 292900,
      "text": "他是二十三位两弹一星功勋奖章获得者中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 293320,
      "end_ms": 298490,
      "text": "最后一个被解密的当卸下身上所有的重担。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 298550,
      "end_ms": 300485,
      "text": "那张延素了几十年的脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 301260,
      "end_ms": 303485,
      "text": "终于又一次笑了起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 304140,
      "end_ms": 305775,
      "text": "这发自内心的一笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 306420,
      "end_ms": 307335,
      "text": "一不小心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 308150,
      "end_ms": 310210,
      "text": "就相隔了几十个年头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 311290,
      "end_ms": 320810,
      "text": "二零零四年国际编号幺零三八八号的小行星被正式命名为朱光亚星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 321590,
      "end_ms": 324290,
      "text": "他的名字永远挂在了天上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 325250,
      "end_ms": 328890,
      "text": "二零一一年二月二十六号朱光亚走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 329190,
      "end_ms": 330690,
      "text": "享年八十七岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 331670,
      "end_ms": 332950,
      "text": "那天下着大雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 333490,
      "end_ms": 335410,
      "text": "好多人望着天上的雪说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 335850,
      "end_ms": 337805,
      "text": "钱学森走的那天也下雪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 338440,
      "end_ms": 338980,
      "text": "真巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 339260,
      "end_ms": 340160,
      "text": "其实不是巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 340240,
      "end_ms": 341180,
      "text": "是天在哭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 342140,
      "end_ms": 347580,
      "text": "最后我想说被埋进黑暗里的不止朱光雅一个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 347880,
      "end_ms": 350640,
      "text": "二十三位两弹一星元勋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 351040,
      "end_ms": 352740,
      "text": "郭永怀飞机失事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 353260,
      "end_ms": 355420,
      "text": "用身体护住绝密文件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 355960,
      "end_ms": 356920,
      "text": "烧成焦炭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 357080,
      "end_ms": 357880,
      "text": "也没松手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 358780,
      "end_ms": 361880,
      "text": "邓稼先因核辐射身患重症，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 362260,
      "end_ms": 367815,
      "text": "临死前说的最后一句话是不要让人家把我们落的太远。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 369000,
      "end_ms": 372955,
      "text": "这些人干的是惊天动地的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 373500,
      "end_ms": 375925,
      "text": "做的是隐姓埋名的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 376780,
      "end_ms": 379280,
      "text": "他们才是这个国家最硬的脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 379460,
      "end_ms": 381595,
      "text": "才是我们最该追的星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 382300,
      "end_ms": 382920,
      "text": "说实话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 383260,
      "end_ms": 384620,
      "text": "写朱光亚的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 384840,
      "end_ms": 386485,
      "text": "我翻了大量的资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 386830,
      "end_ms": 387810,
      "text": "越翻越难受。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 388190,
      "end_ms": 390345,
      "text": "二十三位两弹一星元勋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 390840,
      "end_ms": 394865,
      "text": "每一个人的故事单独拿出来都能让你掉眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 395940,
      "end_ms": 396825,
      "text": "但说实话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 397610,
      "end_ms": 400845,
      "text": "大多数人的名字我们根本叫不上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 401230,
      "end_ms": 403465,
      "text": "他们把一生都给了国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 403920,
      "end_ms": 404580,
      "text": "走的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 404580,
      "end_ms": 408115,
      "text": "安安静静连张照片都没留下几张。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 408580,
      "end_ms": 411315,
      "text": "后来我找到了这套国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 411860,
      "end_ms": 416120,
      "text": "里面写了四十多位中国科学家的真实人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 416340,
      "end_ms": 420235,
      "text": "钱学森、邓稼先、郭永怀、袁隆平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 420630,
      "end_ms": 424395,
      "text": "一个一个全是我们这个民族的顶梁柱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 424940,
      "end_ms": 427355,
      "text": "他不是那种干巴巴的人物简介，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00159",
      "start_ms": 427700,
      "end_ms": 429675,
      "text": "是真写他们怎么吃苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00160",
      "start_ms": 430170,
      "end_ms": 430955,
      "text": "怎么咬牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00161",
      "start_ms": 431340,
      "end_ms": 432965,
      "text": "怎么把命豁出去的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00162",
      "start_ms": 433850,
      "end_ms": 434390,
      "text": "读的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00163",
      "start_ms": 434390,
      "end_ms": 437505,
      "text": "你会发现这些人不是天生的英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00164",
      "start_ms": 438360,
      "end_ms": 439545,
      "text": "他们也是丈夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00165",
      "start_ms": 440000,
      "end_ms": 440725,
      "text": "是父亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00166",
      "start_ms": 441170,
      "end_ms": 441925,
      "text": "是儿子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00167",
      "start_ms": 442710,
      "end_ms": 444805,
      "text": "只是在国家需要的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00168",
      "start_ms": 445320,
      "end_ms": 447185,
      "text": "选择了把自己藏起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00169",
      "start_ms": 447990,
      "end_ms": 453200,
      "text": "我建议你买一套自己看也留给孩子看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00170",
      "start_ms": 453360,
      "end_ms": 455840,
      "text": "现在的孩子追着明星唱首歌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00171",
      "start_ms": 456040,
      "end_ms": 458005,
      "text": "拍个戏就被捧上天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00172",
      "start_ms": 458440,
      "end_ms": 461140,
      "text": "但真正该让孩子记住的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00173",
      "start_ms": 461140,
      "end_ms": 463740,
      "text": "这些在戈壁滩上用算盘算。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00174",
      "start_ms": 463780,
      "end_ms": 468725,
      "text": "原子弹的人是这些用身体互助绝密文件的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00175",
      "start_ms": 469380,
      "end_ms": 474825,
      "text": "让孩子知道这个国家能有今天不是靠运气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00176",
      "start_ms": 475520,
      "end_ms": 478165,
      "text": "是靠一群人拿命换的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00177",
      "start_ms": 479070,
      "end_ms": 481025,
      "text": "这些人不该被遗忘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1ccaa57653cd78f_s00178",
      "start_ms": 481880,
      "end_ms": 485415,
      "text": "这套书就是给他们立的一块碑。"
    }
  ],
